# Unattended Advanced/36 appliance.
#
# The included file defines the machine and its stations; the volume (not
# distributed with SIM/36; put yours at var/as36.img, next to etc/) is
# attached here as an overlay, and bare `ipl` then owns the processor across
# the guest's idle waits.  Connect an ordinary tn5250 client to the
# multiplexer (127.0.0.1:2300) and pick a station.  No monitor restart or
# instruction-count driving is needed.

do sim36.sim
attach disk0 ../var/as36.img overlay
ipl
